      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm object on this canny because we can increase the number of polygons that are actually drawn with in-shader multi-pass rendering similar to multi-material multi-pass rendering.\n\nActually, most recent shaders with outline, including lilToon, toonStandard, and poiyomi, do in-shader multi-pass rendering.\n\nIt might be reasonable to count multi-material multi-pass rendering for mobile avatars since no shaders do in-shader multi-pass, but I think counting for PC is not reasonable.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
